<p>
    This incident is shown because of a critical PHP error.
</p>

<p>
    Error information:
    <table class="table table-bordered">
        <tr>
            <td>Code</td><td>{{ incident.getFirstEvent().getType() }}</td>
        </tr>
        <tr>
            <td>File</td><td>{{ incident.getFirstEvent().getFile() }}</td>
        </tr>
        <tr>
            <td>Line</td><td>{{ incident.getFirstEvent().getLine() }}</td>
        </tr>
    </table>

    Error log:
    <table class="table table-bordered">
        {% for error in incident.getEvents() %}
            <tr>
                <td>{{ error.getDateCreated()|date }}</td>
                <td>{{ error.getMessage() }}</td>
            </tr>
        {% endfor %}
    </table>
</p>

<p>
    We'll be glad if you report this error to DeskPRO, we'll fix it ASAP.
</p>
